        "identifier": "https://github.com/geoconuk/kolmogorov-arnold",
        "note": "The standalone development this same formalisation was built in, not an earlier or independent formalisation. The three statements were fixed there as a target file with the strongest left as a hole, read back blind, compared against the primaries and read by the author, and the proof was then built against them, in six layers, without the target changing; the finished modules, as of its commit f291465, were copied verbatim into the submitted repository on 2026-09-11 with only namespaces and docstrings changed, and released there as v0.3.0. The submitted repository contains the substantive development and is the copy under its audit, conventions and release discipline, and the copy its own README says a citation should name; the development repository is listed so that the fixed-target arrangement and the order of construction can be inspected as they happened.",
        "relationship": "other"
      },
      {
        "identifier": "https://github.com/leanprover/lean-eval/blob/main/LeanEval/Analysis/KolmogorovArnold.lean",
        "note": "A statement only, with the proof left as a hole, of the weaker form in which the inner functions may depend on f (for all f there exist phi and g), posed as a benchmark problem. The benchmark records accepted solutions of that form, none of them published, so there is nothing to read or build on; neither the statement nor any solution was used. The submitted statements quantify the inner functions before f, which is the content of the theorem and what separates them from the benchmark form.",
        "relationship": "other"
      }
